          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大きな部分を小さな部分に近づけます．メイクアップゲインで全体をもう一度持ち上げます．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brings this source to the loudness set in Settings › Audio, however loud or quiet it plays on its own. With the original sound replaced, it evens out what you hear too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brings this source to the loudness set in Settings › Audio, however loud or quiet it plays on its own. With the original sound replaced, it evens out what you hear too."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
