    "macOS does not place a new menu bar icon once other apps have filled the bar, so Tapdeck's icon is not drawn. Free some room — hold Command and drag another icon out of the menu bar — and relaunch Tapdeck; after that the icon keeps its place like any other.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS does not place a new menu bar icon once other apps have filled the bar, so Tapdeck's icon is not drawn. Free some room — hold Command and drag another icon out of the menu bar — and relaunch Tapdeck; after that the icon keeps its place like any other."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ほかのアプリでメニューバーがいっぱいになると，macOS は新しいアイコンを配置しないため，Tapdeck のアイコンは表示されません．Command を押しながらほかのアイコンをメニューバーの外へドラッグして空きを作り，Tapdeck を起動し直してください．以後は，ほかのアイコンと同じように場所が保たれます．"
          }
        }
      }
    },
